    {
      "id": "prompt_warranty_check",
      "provider": "prompt",
      "config": {
        "instructions": [
          "You are a simple warranty-eligibility calculator. You will be given a purchase_date and a warranty_duration_months. Perform basic date arithmetic only \u2014 do not reason about anything else.\n\nINPUT: purchase_date (YYYY-MM-DD), warranty_duration_months (number), today's date is provided or assume current system date.\n\nCALCULATE:\n- warranty_expiry_date (string, YYYY-MM-DD): purchase_date + warranty_duration_months\n- warranty_active (boolean): true if today is before warranty_expiry_date\n- days_remaining_or_expired (number): positive number of days remaining if active, negative number of days since expiry if not active\n\nRULES:\n- This is pure arithmetic. Do not apply judgment, exceptions, or leniency.\n- If purchase_date is null or invalid, return warranty_active: false and add a field \"error\": \"invalid_purchase_date\".\n- Output strict JSON only. No preamble, no explanation, no markdown fences.\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (strict JSON, no other text):\n{\n  \"warranty_expiry_date\": string or null,\n  \"warranty_active\": boolean,\n  \"days_remaining_or_expired\": number or null,\n  \"error\": string or null\n}"
        ],
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 1260,
          "y": -100
        },
        "nodeType": "default",
        "formDataValid": true
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "documents",
          "from": "doc_data_converter"
        },
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "question_warranty_check"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_warranty_check",
      "provider": "llm_openai_api",
      "config": {
        "profile": "custom",
        "custom": {
